  "bodyHash": "5e50cee22e6ebcb2",
  "content": "\n\n这是 [Create Ore Excavation](https://github.com/mikeee1/create_ore_excavation_plus) 的附属模组，使通过钻头获取钻石和绿宝石变得更加困难。我制作这个模组是因为原版机制有些过于强大。\n\n \n将粗绿宝石和粗钻石转化为普通绿宝石和钻石的流程如下：\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>剧透</summary>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">1.&nbsp; 将粗钻石与 50mB 液体混合，获得加热粗钻石或钻石粉。<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AhMH6Zj.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"728\" height=\"428\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">1.5 使用 16 个钻石粉合成粗钻石</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/S867Pxk.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"732\" height=\"432\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">2. 清洗加热粗钻石以获得水洗粗钻石</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sWLxlgs.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"729\" height=\"306\"><br>3. 切割水洗粗钻石以获得切割粗钻石</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ph4bGBt.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"740\" height=\"311\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">4. 压榨切割粗钻石以获得压制粗钻石</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oZIZ7wb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"742\" height=\"312\"><br>5. 抛光压制粗钻石以获得钻石<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jHWph32.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"744\" height=\"255\"></span></p></div>\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n \n将粗红石转化为普通红石的方式也有些许变化：\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>剧透</summary>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>1. 粉碎粗红石</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ssdJpbe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"741\" height=\"433\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>2. 向破碎红石中注入 100mB 的水</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/meSCZLe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"740\" height=\"312\"></p></div>\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n \n<span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">下界合金的处理方式则稍有不同：<br></span>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>剧透</summary>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">1. 钻取粗下界合金碎片</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hvros7o.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"728\" height=\"422\"><br>2. 冶炼粗下界合金碎片以获得烧焦的下界合金碎片</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ezb6xBY.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"738\" height=\"310\"><br>3. 驱灵处理烧焦的下界合金碎片以获得闹鬼的粗下界合金碎片</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KEuPGLS.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"734\" height=\"310\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">4. 熏制闹鬼的粗下界合金碎片以获得窑烧的下界合金碎片</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mc7MeLo.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"733\" height=\"311\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">5. 将窑烧的下界合金碎片与岩浆混合，获得熔岩浸润的下界合金碎片</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SOZ6Pf8.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"729\" height=\"430\"><br>6. 将熔岩浸润的下界合金碎片投入水中，获得下界合金碎片</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XYm7Crz.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"733\" height=\"307\"></span></p></div>\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n \n<span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">新增了通过压榨下界合金碎片和金锭来制作下界合金锭的功能。<br><br>要开采下界合金，你需要使用终极钻头，制作配方如下：<br></span>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Y4oeDLq.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"729\" height=\"445\"></p></div>\n\n \n<span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">&nbsp;现在你也可以使用流体提取器从主世界和下界提取岩浆。</span>",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
